    "Global-route RC estimates under the same 20 ns constraints and three corners. Fast cells remain -40C and SRAM -55C.",
    "Exploratory area is 359776.2816 um2: 364.6944 above this experiment source and 403.8433632 above the historical repair allowance. Die outline is unchanged.",
    "The complete inherited watchlist and all added branches are measured; this result rejects qualification rather than claiming layout closure.",
    "Two macro output fanout limits are absent from the reports and retained as unknown. Capacitance, slew and actual pin counts are reconciled independently.",
    "Incremental route grids are partial and are not used as whole-chip congestion evidence.",
    "The candidate router reports 16 overflow units (15 Metal3, 1 Metal4); the stored grid exposes 15 on Metal3. The extra Metal4 unit is unreconciled. Two read-only API probes found opaque native matrix views, without resolving it. Both quantities remain explicit and qualification is denied.",
    "Minimum pin access does not prove simultaneous routability, extracted timing, antenna, layout or power signoff.",
    "Actual Verilog buffer contraction and exact ODB readbacks preserve the circuit under pinned cell interpretations; no new Lean theorem or complete paired package refinement is claimed.",
    "Final review corrected bus-pin cache-key shadowing. The regression fails before the fix; the final suite passes and all five saved physical comparisons reproduce exactly. The original sealed report and manifest remain retained."
  ],
